<title>USA: IMM CURRENCY FUTURES MIXED, STERLING SLUMPS.</title>
<headline>IMM CURRENCY FUTURES MIXED, STERLING SLUMPS.</headline>
<text>
<p>Aug 7 - IMM currency futures were mixed, as recent laggards recovered and sterling slumped. Sept sterling down sharply but above $1.58 support after falling through there early. Traders say Thursday rate hike last for now. Session low at $1.5756 daily support. Spot levels at 1.88 marks and 119 yen cap dollar.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail:chicago.derivatives.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
